<p style="<%= email_style(:p) %>">Hello <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>

<p style="<%= email_style(:p) %>"><%= @added_by.display_name %> (<%= @added_by.email %>) added you to <strong><%= @group.name %></strong> on WISP as <%= @owner ? "an owner" : "a member" %>. You can now view and update its farms, pivots and fields.</p>

<p style="<%= email_style(:p) %>">Once you've signed in, switch to <%= @group.name %> with the operation menu at the top of the page.</p>

<%= email_button "Open WISP", @url %>

<p style="<%= email_style(:p, :muted) %>;font-size:14px">If you weren't expecting this, you can leave the operation from its page in WISP.</p>
